  "code" : "public int[] maxSubarrayWithPrint(int[] arr) {\n    int maxi = Integer.MIN_VALUE, sum = 0;\n    int start = 0, ansStart = -1, ansEnd = -1;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {\n        if (sum == 0) start = i;\n        sum += arr[i];\n        if (sum > maxi) {\n            maxi = sum;\n            ansStart = start;\n            ansEnd = i;\n        }\n        if (sum < 0) {\n            sum = 0;\n        }\n    }\n    return Arrays.copyOfRange(arr, ansStart, ansEnd + 1);\n}",
